  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing avgpool aggregation with transformer aggregation in a ViT-L-based multimodal setup using concat fusion, achieving validation accuracy of 0.7207. The result suggests transformer aggregation may improve performance compared to avgpool, though the role of other factors like encoder complexity or fusion method remains untested. The higher accuracy relative to previous ViT-L setups (e.g., 0.7062) indicates potential benefits from the aggregation change, but further experiments are needed to isolate its impact."
}

